cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use this project, please cite it as follows."
type: software
title: "TheraSim: A Local-First Framework for Psychotherapy Skills Simulation and Evaluation"
abstract: >-
  TheraSim is an experimental, local-first research and educational prototype
  for psychotherapy-skills simulation with fictional cases. It combines a
  FastAPI backend, a React interface, SQLite persistence, and optional local
  language-model providers. ACT is currently the only runnable modality.
  Evaluation and analytics features are exploratory and do not establish
  clinical or psychometric validity.
keywords:
  - psychotherapy simulation
  - research software
  - educational software
  - local language models
  - Acceptance and Commitment Therapy
authors:
